[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16388.99, "timestamp": "04:33:08", "text": "女士。有点累了。我有点累了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16392.789, "timestamp": "04:33:12", "text": "摇晃。是的。你应该睡觉了。我觉得我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16399.67, "timestamp": "04:33:19", "text": "明天。酒精比毒品更糟糕"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16404.23, "timestamp": "04:33:24", "text": "观点。是的，你应该睡到……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16405.949, "timestamp": "04:33:25", "text": "明天。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16415.59, "timestamp": "04:33:35", "text": "更好的。我睡不着。我得到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16417.109, "timestamp": "04:33:37", "text": "躺到床上，所有这些恐怖的回忆都涌上心头。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16420.15, "timestamp": "04:33:40", "text": "飘回我身边。哦，不。我想我会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16422.99, "timestamp": "04:33:42", "text": "祈祷其他人也能"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16426.789, "timestamp": "04:33:46", "text": "得了失眠症，然后我就可以吃点东西了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16429.551, "timestamp": "04:33:49", "text": "今晚睡个好觉。哦不，那是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16432.869, "timestamp": "04:33:52", "text": "坏的。我将成为守护天使。困"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16435.23, "timestamp": "04:33:55", "text": "时间"}]